# Riverpod

- Screen controller is a `ViewModel` that **is** the `Notifier` / `AsyncNotifier`. Never ViewModel + Notifier as two classes.
- One-shot read, no later mutation → `FutureProvider` is OK.
- Submit, pagination page N+1, retry, pull-to-refresh → `AsyncNotifier` / `Notifier`. Pagination is always AsyncNotifier.
- Session owner: `authSessionProvider` (`AuthSessionController`). Do not invent `authStateProvider`.
- Locale switching: `localeProvider`. Strings: `context.tr`.
- Watch with `ref.watch` / `select`. Dispose CancelTokens in `ref.onDispose()`.
- Folders: `presentation/viewmodels/`, `presentation/providers/`.

```dart
// BAD
class LoginViewModel {}
class LoginNotifier extends AsyncNotifier<LoginState> {}

// GOOD
class LoginViewModel extends AsyncNotifier<LoginState> {
  @override
  LoginState build() => const LoginState();
}
```
